        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>人民日报 7.24 文章精选</title>\n  <script src=\"https://polyfill.io/v3/polyfill.min.js?features=es6\"></script>\n  <script id=\"MathJax-script\" async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n  <style>\n    *{box-sizing:border-box}\n    html,body{margin:0;width:540px;min-height:721px}\n    body{\n      font-family:\"Microsoft YaHei\",\"PingFang SC\",\"Noto Sans CJK SC\",Arial,sans-serif;\n      color:#191919;\n      background-color:#fffef4;\n      background-image:\n        linear-gradient(rgba(126,153,124,.13) 1px,transparent 1px),\n        linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(126,153,124,.13) 1px,transparent 1px);\n      background-size:12px 12px;\n      overflow:hidden;\n    }\n    .page{width:540px;min-height:721px}\n    .masthead{\n      height:116px;\n      position:relative;\n      border-bottom:3px solid #a21918;\n    }\n    .seal{\n      position:absolute;left:2px;top:4px;width:107px;height:106px;\n      display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;grid-template-rows:1fr 1fr;\n      background:#af1820;border-radius:4px;padding:3px;gap:2px;\n    }\n    .seal span{\n      color:#fffdf5;font-size:42px;line-height:48px;text-align:center;\n      border:2px solid #fffdf5;font-family:serif;font-weight:bold;\n    }\n    .paper-title{\n      position:absolute;left:124px;top:11px;color:#cc2530;\n      font-family:\"STKaiti\",\"KaiTi\",serif;font-size:31px;font-weight:bold;\n      letter-spacing:2px;white-space:nowrap;\n    }\n    .date{\n      font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-weight:normal;font-size:23px;\n      margin-left:3px;letter-spacing:0;\n    }\n    .header-notes{\n      position:absolute;right:6px;top:3px;width:89px;\n      font-size:13px;line-height:20px;color:#333;\n    }\n    .header-notes .line{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between}\n    .pill{display:inline-block;width:45px;height:12px;border-radius:8px;opacity:.72}\n    .pink{background:#f18b8f}.orange{background:#f4ba78}.cyan{background:#57ddd4}\n    .headline{\n      position:absolute;left:140px;bottom:9px;font-size:20px;font-weight:800;\n      letter-spacing:.2px;\n    }\n    .content{display:flex;width:540px}\n    .article{width:402px;padding:11px 8px 0 0}\n    .side{\n      width:138px;border-left:3px solid #c42527;padding-left:5px;\n      font-size:12px;line-height:18px;min-height:605px;\n    }\n    .topic{\n      margin:0 -0px 10px -5px;height:31px;padding:4px 4px;\n      background:#ffd72f;color:#c51b20;font-weight:bold;font-size:17px;\n      line-height:22px;white-space:nowrap;\n    }\n    .para{\n      position:relative;padding-left:0;margin:0 0 12px 0;\n      font-size:14px;line-height:22px;text-align:left;\n    }\n    .para .num,.side .num{\n      display:inline-block;background:#17b9dc;color:#fff;border-radius:2px;\n      font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11px;font-weight:bold;\n      text-align:center;line-height:13px;height:13px;min-width:13px;\n      vertical-align:2px;margin-left:17px;margin-right:3px;\n    }\n    .para.one{background:linear-gradient(transparent 12px,rgba(255,231,155,.43) 12px,rgba(255,231,155,.43) 77px,transparent 77px)}\n    .para.two{\n      background:linear-gradient(transparent 12px,rgba(80,223,209,.37) 12px,rgba(80,223,209,.37) 100px,transparent 100px);\n      margin-bottom:10px;\n    }\n    .para.three{\n      background:\n        linear-gradient(transparent 12px,rgba(245,156,175,.28) 12px,rgba(245,156,175,.28) 211px,transparent 211px);\n      margin-bottom:9px;\n    }\n    .para.four{\n      background:linear-gradient(transparent 12px,rgba(205,168,241,.25) 12px,rgba(205,168,241,.25) 122px,transparent 122px);\n    }\n    .side p{margin:0 0 9px 0}\n    .side .num{margin-left:0;margin-right:3px}\n    .side .section{margin-bottom:11px}\n    .side .mark-yellow{background:rgba(255,224,70,.5)}\n    .side .mark-cyan{background:rgba(66,224,216,.33)}\n    .side .mark-pink{background:rgba(255,161,181,.25)}\n    .side .mark-purple{background:rgba(207,171,237,.25)}\n    .side strong{font-weight:normal}\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <div class=\"page\">\n    <header class=\"masthead\">\n      <div class=\"seal\"><span>中</span><span>论</span><span>积</span><span>累</span></div>\n      <div class=\"paper-title\">人民日报<span class=\"date\">7.24</span>文章精选</div>\n      <div class=\"header-notes\">\n        <div class=\"line\"><span>论点</span><i class=\"pill pink\"></i></div>\n        <div class=\"line\"><span>论据</span><i class=\"pill orange\"></i></div>\n        <div class=\"line\"><span>对策</span><i class=\"pill cyan\"></i></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"headline\">涵养“自找苦吃”的精气神</div>\n    </header>\n\n    <main class=\"content\">\n      <section class=\"article\">\n        <p class=\"para one\"><span class=\"num\">1</span>苦难成就辉煌，困难磨砺青春。“你们在信中说，走进乡土中<br>国深处，才深刻理解什么是实事求是、怎么去联系群众，青年人就要<br>“自找苦吃”，说得很好。”不久前，领导给中国农业大学科技小院<br>的同学们回信，充分肯定同学们走进乡土中国深处“自找苦吃”的精<br>神，强调“新时代中国青年就应该有这股精气神”。</p>\n\n        <p class=\"para two\"><span class=\"num\">2</span>自找苦吃”就是要敢于挑最难最重的担子，敢于到条件艰苦、<br>环境复杂的岗位锻炼，在经受大风大浪、艰难困苦中磨炼意志、增长<br>才干。青年人要成长成才，就要到更广阔的天地、更复杂的环境中去<br>历练锻造，多经历一点摔打、挫折、考验，这样才能增益其所不能，<br>练就担当的宽肩膀、成事的真本领。</p>\n\n        <p class=\"para three\"><span class=\"num\">3</span>肯吃苦、能吃苦，是一代又一代中国青年茁壮成长的必经之<br>路。犹记上世纪60年代，300名青年组成突击队，迎难而上、不怕啃<br>“硬骨头”，将地势险要、石质坚硬的岩壁凿通，将红旗渠渠线延伸<br>了最艰难的16公里。进入新时代，无论是逐梦星辰大海的年轻航天队<br>伍，还是积极参与支教支边、用脚步丈量祖国大地的青年学生;无论<br>是奋战在脱贫攻坚一线、用汗水和赤诚践行对村诺言的第一书记，还<br>是在边防一线为保卫祖国奉献青春的95后、00后……无数青年不怕<br>苦、不畏难，在“自找苦吃”中经风雨、见世面，在热火朝天的社会<br>实践中努力书写青春华章，展现出奋发有为、甘于奉献的精神风貌。</p>\n\n        <p class=\"para four\"><span class=\"num\">4</span>梅花香自苦寒来。青年时代，选择吃苦也就选择了收获，选择<br>奉献也就选择了高尚。有驻村第一书记坦言，基层工作很苦、琐碎，<br>但正是在全心全意为人民服务的过程中，自己找到了把所学知识转化<br>为业务优势的切入点。科技小院的学生们“自找苦吃”进村“读<br>研”，为当地村民带来了无数的“甜”，也在摸爬滚打中练就了</p>\n      </section>\n\n      <aside class=\"side\">\n        <div class=\"topic\">话题：人生精神</div>\n        <p class=\"section\">论点：青年人就要“自<br>找苦吃”</p>\n\n        <p class=\"section mark-yellow\"><span class=\"num\">1</span>过滤题<br>自找苦吃”就是要敢于挑<br>最难最重的担子</p>\n\n        <p class=\"section mark-cyan\"><span class=\"num\">2</span>对策：就要到更广阔<br>的天地、更复杂的环境中<br>去历练锻造（论述自找苦<br>吃的释义，对策）</p>\n\n        <p class=\"section mark-pink\"><span class=\"num\">1</span>分论点一：<br>能吃苦、肯吃苦是代代青<br>年茁壮成长的必经之路</p>\n\n        <p class=\"section mark-pink\"><span class=\"num\">2</span>事例：上世纪60年代:<br>红旗渠青年突击队、新时<br>代航天队伍、支教支边<br>的青年学生、第一书记、<br>戍边战士么做青年不怕<br>苦、不畏难，在“自找苦<br>吃”中经风雨、见世面</p>\n\n        <p class=\"section mark-purple\"><span class=\"num\">1</span>分论点二：选择吃苦<br>也就选择了收获，选择奉<br>献也就选择了高尚</p>\n\n        <p class=\"section mark-purple\"><span class=\"num\">2</span>事例：驻村第一书记:<br>找到了把所学知识转化为<br>业务优势的切入点；科技<br>小院的学生们：在摸爬滚<br>打中练就了技艺</p>\n      </aside>\n    </main>\n  </div>\n</body>\n</html>"
